  - "Giao nhanh n\xF3ng h\u1ED5i nha c\u1EADu y\xEAu <3"
  - "Kh\xF4ng sao \u0111\xE2u!"
  - "\u0110\u1EC3 h\xF4m nay t\xF4i nh\u1ECBn \u0111\xF3i"
  - "Ch\u01B0a \u0111\u1EE7 m\xE0 c\u1EADu"
  - "V\u1EC1 r\u1ED3i \xE0, tr\xF4ng ngon nh\u01B0 ch\xE1u v\u1EADy"
  - "Anh g\u1EEDi b\xE9 ti\u1EC1n ship n\xE8 <3"
